    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/34dcd5af980b5994e7e8b460d7a4d114.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Wolfpine has always been the final stop for adventurers before they delve into the Shifting Lands - a region full of monsters and treasures. Now, the village lies in ruins, and the locals desperately need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Lynn, a young woman who unexpectedly inherits a plot of land in this village and is thrust into the quest to restore it to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/455f503f24c64358851bedef6cc84f7b.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Embark on exciting adventures on a procedurally generated map filled with monsters to battle and events to encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/6391517fe23b8517a3b7d25152b219dd.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Choose the best skills for the current adventure and watch them in action during dynamic auto-battle turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/b052a7c66a14b8cf32da35879e8e1d36.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Enhance your skills while resting in Wolfpine, unlocking new combat abilities and discovering powerful artifacts and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/b8243c9eb3a5973d8c03598f1f28188f.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Encounter various characters during your travels or while spending time in Wolfpine. Some of them will want to help you, while others have more direct and lustful intentions towards your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/911a0299ff507b7bc0a380aca441133c.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Each adventure on the world map is procedurally generated and therefore different. The defeat is not permanent, just return, regroup and try again. Next time you will be more lucky on your quest of restoring the Lecherous Village.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/34dcd5af980b5994e7e8b460d7a4d114.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Wolfpine has always been the final stop for adventurers before they delve into the Shifting Lands - a region full of monsters and treasures. Now, the village lies in ruins, and the locals desperately need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Lynn, a young woman who unexpectedly inherits a plot of land in this village and is thrust into the quest to restore it to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/455f503f24c64358851bedef6cc84f7b.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Embark on exciting adventures on a procedurally generated map filled with monsters to battle and events to encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/6391517fe23b8517a3b7d25152b219dd.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Choose the best skills for the current adventure and watch them in action during dynamic auto-battle turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/b052a7c66a14b8cf32da35879e8e1d36.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Enhance your skills while resting in Wolfpine, unlocking new combat abilities and discovering powerful artifacts and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/b8243c9eb3a5973d8c03598f1f28188f.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Encounter various characters during your travels or while spending time in Wolfpine. Some of them will want to help you, while others have more direct and lustful intentions towards your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/911a0299ff507b7bc0a380aca441133c.webp?t=1753170034\" width=500 height=62 /></span><br>Each adventure on the world map is procedurally generated and therefore different. The defeat is not permanent, just return, regroup and try again. Next time you will be more lucky on your quest of restoring the Lecherous Village.</p>",
